# A triggered ability on the stack exists independently of its source (CR 113.7a), and a text-changing effect changes the
# text of the spell or permanent it affects (CR 612.1), not of an ability already on the stack. Night Nurse, a Hero, entered
# under Bot1's control this turn, so Avengers Assemble!'s end step ability triggers and goes on the stack saying "Hero".
# In response Bot1 casts Artificial Evolution on the Avengers, replacing Hero with Elf. The Avengers' static ability follows
# its new text at once (CR 612, 613.1c): Night Nurse is no Elf, and is no longer boosted (2/1, not 4/3), with the trigger
# still waiting. The trigger resolves with its own text - its intervening "if" checked again (CR 603.4) asks of a Hero, and
# a Hero did enter - so Bot1 draws a card.

[Bot1 Deck]
Avengers Assemble!
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Night Nurse, Healer of Heroes
Artificial Evolution
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

